      "message": "Flagging potential iLoadStepRate concerns for posterity.\n\n* Some HW fast-ramping methods will OCP partners and cause Type-C disconnect..\n* Some boards don\u0027t have HW ramp, so must use SW or will cause Type-C disconnect.\n\nDeferring and monitoring for long term stability impact.",
